<title>THAILAND: Thai March trade deficit widens to 22.2 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai March trade deficit widens to 22.2 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday Thailand's trade deficit narrowed (widened) to 22.2 billion baht in March from 21.7 billion in February and against 40.4 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE    March 97     Feb 97	March 96</p>
<p>	  Exports		126.9	108.6	  121.1</p>
<p>	  Imports		149.1	130.3	  161.5</p>
<p>	  Trade balance	-22.2	-21.7	  -40.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
